OL,5,G2330 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FVera drops a hint to Kay that she
OL,7,     Fshould spy on Bea and find out
OL,8,     Fwhat's going on. Bea objects when
OL,9,     FVera brings Kay to the laundry to
OL,10,     Fwork, but Vera assigns Doreen to
OL,11,     Flook after her.
OL,12,G0030 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FBea barricades Kay's cell door to
OL,14,     Fensure that they can have a
OL,15,     F"private chat". The ensuing fight
OL,16,     Fis broken up by Vera and Meg, and
OL,17,     FBea ends up in solitary.
